// §19.3.1 CfgAtom valued form: RHS MUST be DOUBLE_STRING_LITERAL (not unquoted bare identifier)
// Covers rule: cfgAtom (3-alt group: alt 2 fires — CfgOp present but no quoted RHS → ZOM1900)
// Expected: REJECT
